{"seq":2,"slug":"inspect-grade-regrade","title":"到检验机与重新定级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/inspect-grade-regrade","wordCount":2116,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"到检验机与重新定级\">到检验机与重新定级</h1><p>旧设备到验机台的那一刻，是整条换新链路上唯一产生<strong>客观事实</strong>的节点。在此之前的一切数字——用户自述、估价模型输出、报价区间——都是估计；在此之后，设备状态被逐项确认为真或为假，并由此产生一个可以支撑资金结算的实检价。验机设计的质量直接决定了差异结算的争议率：验机项定得粗，差异无法归因；定得细但不可复现，不同验机员之间就产生系统性偏差，用户会怀疑平台的公正性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-验机项与特征的一一对应\">核心概念：验机项与特征的一一对应</h2><p>验机的第一原则是<strong>验机项必须与报价时的特征快照一一对应</strong>，不多不少。多出来的项无法映射到抵扣规则，只能变成「平台单方面认定」的黑箱；少掉的项意味着报价时的某个假设永远不会被核对。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[报价特征快照] --&gt; M{逐项比对}&#10;  I[验机实测] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt;|一致| S1[不产生差异]&#10;  M --&gt;|实检更差| S2[生成下调差异明细]&#10;  M --&gt;|实检更好| S3[默认不调整&lt;br/&gt;见置信度篇的不对称设计]&#10;  S2 --&gt; P[计算实检价]&#10;  S3 --&gt; P&#10;  P --&gt; R[重新定级 -&gt; 进入处置路线]\">graph TD\n  Q[报价特征快照] --&gt; M{逐项比对}\n  I[验机实测] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt;|一致| S1[不产生差异]\n  M --&gt;|实检更差| S2[生成下调差异明细]\n  M --&gt;|实检更好| S3[默认不调整&lt;br/&gt;见置信度篇的不对称设计]\n  S2 --&gt; P[计算实检价]\n  S3 --&gt; P\n  P --&gt; R[重新定级 -&gt; 进入处置路线]</pre><p>比对必须是<strong>逐项独立</strong>的，而不是由验机员给一个综合评级。综合评级看起来更简洁，但它把多维状态压成一维，导致差异无法归因——用户被告知「综合评级下调」时无法理解哪里出了问题，复核也失去了着力点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报价特征</th>\n<th>验机实测方式</th>\n<th>可复现性</th>\n<th>争议概率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>屏幕状态</td>\n<td>目检 + 触摸 + 特定角度光照</td>\n<td>中（依赖光照与标准）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背板/边框</td>\n<td>目检 + 高分辨率拍照</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能完好</td>\n<td>自动化功能测试脚本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电池健康</td>\n<td>读取系统电池数据</td>\n<td>高（可读数字）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆修记录</td>\n<td>外观痕迹 + 螺丝检查</td>\n<td>低（判断主观）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备锁状态</td>\n<td>接口查询激活锁</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规律很清楚：<strong>凡是能读到数字的项争议最少，凡是靠目检与主观判断的项争议最多</strong>。这个规律给验机设计的直接指导是——尽可能把主观项转化为可测量的量。屏幕划痕可以用「在固定光照角度下拍摄并与标准样张比对」来降低主观性；拆修记录可以用螺丝胶痕的分级样本来标定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验机标准的分级标定\">验机标准的分级标定</h2><p>不同验机机构之间的判定差异是一个必须被主动管理的量。管理方式是<strong>标准样本标定</strong>：准备一组已知状态的标准设备（黄金样本），定期让各验机机构对这组样本定级，比较机构间的判定一致性。</p>\n<p>衡量一致性的指标用 Cohen&#39;s kappa 比较合适，因为它扣除了随机一致的部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际一致率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是随机期望一致率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 的值越大表示一致性越高。当某个机构的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 相对基准显著偏低，说明该机构的判定标准漂移，需要重新培训或复核其历史判定。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 验机机构一致性监控：按机构与验机项统计下调率偏离&#10;WITH baseline AS (&#10;  SELECT feature_key,&#10;         AVG(CASE WHEN actual &lt;&gt; declared THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END) AS base_downgrade_rate&#10;  FROM inspection_results&#10;  WHERE inspected_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY feature_key&#10;)&#10;SELECT ir.site_id,&#10;       ir.feature_key,&#10;       AVG(CASE WHEN ir.actual &lt;&gt; ir.declared THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END) AS site_rate,&#10;       b.base_downgrade_rate,&#10;       (AVG(CASE WHEN ir.actual &lt;&gt; ir.declared THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END)&#10;        - b.base_downgrade_rate) AS deviation&#10;FROM inspection_results ir&#10;JOIN baseline b USING (feature_key)&#10;WHERE ir.inspected_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY ir.site_id, ir.feature_key, b.base_downgrade_rate&#10;HAVING ABS(AVG(CASE WHEN ir.actual &lt;&gt; ir.declared THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END)&#10;           - b.base_downgrade_rate) &gt; 0.08&#10;ORDER BY deviation DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 验机机构一致性监控：按机构与验机项统计下调率偏离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature_key,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><