</p>\n<p>不可自动化的项剩两类：外观限制（划痕、凹陷、色差）与拆修痕迹。这两类恰是争议最高的项，因此它们需要额外的流程保障——拍照留证与复核通道。每一条外观类差异都应当绑定至少一张带标准光照的照片，用户在争议页面看到的就是这张照片，而不是验机员的文字描述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从验机结果到实检价\">从验机结果到实检价</h2><p>实检价的计算规则已经在 <a href=\"../used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust\">估价置信度与到检调整</a> 中给出（特征级差异累加，只向下调整）。本篇要补充的是它在验机侧的落地约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;inspection_id&quot;: &quot;ins_44a1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;quote_id&quot;: &quot;q_8f21c&quot;,&#10;  &quot;site_id&quot;: &quot;site_SHA_01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;inspected_at&quot;: &quot;2026-10-06T03:12:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;measured&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;screen&quot;: &quot;scratch&quot;,&#10;    &quot;body&quot;: &quot;intact&quot;,&#10;    &quot;function&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;,&#10;    &quot;battery_health_pct&quot;: 78,&#10;    &quot;battery_band&quot;: &quot;lt80&quot;,&#10;    &quot;repaired&quot;: &quot;no&quot;,&#10;    &quot;activation_lock&quot;: &quot;off&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;photos&quot;: [&quot;screen_45deg.jpg&quot;, &quot;back_macro.jpg&quot;],&#10;    &quot;battery_readout&quot;: &quot;diag_battery.json&quot;,&#10;    &quot;function_test_log&quot;: &quot;ft_20261006.json&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;regrade&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;base_price_cents&quot;: 41200,&#10;    &quot;factor&quot;: 0.78,&#10;    &quot;real_price_cents&quot;: 32136,&#10;    &quot;deltas&quot;: [{ &quot;feature&quot;: &quot;screen&quot;, &quot;declared&quot;: &quot;intact&quot;, &quot;actual&quot;: &quot;scratch&quot;, &quot;factor_delta&quot;: 0.06 }]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"inspection_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\