-dark:#79B8FF\">\"declared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"actual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scratch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"factor_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>结构里有三个必须保留的字段群。<code>measured</code> 是原始实测值（电压、循环次数用数字而不是分档，分档是规则层的派生量）。<code>evidence</code> 是可复核的证据指针，没有它复核只能重新验一次。<code>regrade.deltas</code> 是与报价快照比对的差异明细，它与 <code>evidence</code> 一起构成用户可见的解释材料。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电池健康的分档与数字\">电池健康的分档与数字</h3><p>这里有一个设计选择：电池实测值应当存数字（78%）还是分档（lt80）？答案是两个都存。数字是原始事实，可以用于未来更换分档阈值时重新计算；分档是与报价规则对齐的派生量，用于直接参与因子计算。只存分档会在阈值调整时丢失历史可重算性，只存数字则每次计算都要重跑分档逻辑，容易规则漂移。厂商对电池可用性的定义通常落在一个明确的门槛上（例如设计为在大循环数后仍保留 80% 原始容量，见 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/batteries/why-lithium-ion/\">Apple: Why Lithium-ion</a>），把门槛作为分档边界比拟合连续曲线更稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重新定级与下游路线\">重新定级与下游路线</h2><p>验机输出的是状态向量，它同时服务两个下游：一是实检价计算（本篇），二是处置路线决策（见 <a href=\"../circular-downstream-policy/refurb-resell-recycle-route\">翻新转售与回收处置衔接</a>）。</p>\n<p>这两个用途需要的字段并不完全相同。实检价关心的是「与报价假设的差异」，而处置路线关心的是「设备是否具备翻新/转售的客观条件」——例如激活锁是否关闭、功能是否完好、是否存在结构性损伤。因此验机结果应当同时输出两个视图：差异视图（用于结算）与状态视图（用于路线决策）。把两者混成一个字段会在新增处置渠道时被迫改结算逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def route_decision(measured):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;状态视图 -&gt; 处置路线建议（最终决策见处置章）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    if measured[&quot;activation_lock&quot;] != &quot;off&quot;:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;return_to_owner&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;activation_lock_on&quot;}&#10;    if measured[&quot;function&quot;] == &quot;partial&quot; or measured[&quot;body&quot;] == &quot;deformed&quot;:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;recycle&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;not_refurbishable&quot;}&#10;    if measured[&quot;screen&quot;] == &quot;cracked&quot;:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;refurb_part_swap&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;repairable_defect&quot;}&#10;    return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;refurb_resell&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;meets_refurb_grade&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> route_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(measured):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"状态视图 -> 处置路线建议（最终决策见处置章）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activation_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_to_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activation_lock_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"partial\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"deformed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"not_refurbishable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"cracked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refurb_part_swap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"repairable_defect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refurb_resell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"meets_refurb_grade\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>route_decision</code> 返回的是<strong>建议</strong>而不是终局：最终路线还要叠加市场需求与合规约束，那是第四章的内容。把建议逻辑放在验机构建里，让结算与路线共享同一份实测数据，可以避免两处各自读取再产生不一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复核与重新验机\">复核与重新验机</h3><p>复核请求的入口必须由 <code>deltas</code> 驱动，而不是一个笼统的「我不服」按钮。用户针对某一条差异项发起复核，系统把该差异项与对应证据（照片、测试日志）一起送交复核。复核的两种结果：维持原判（附带更充分的证据说明）、或改判（覆盖实测值并重算实检价）。无论哪种，都应当在验机记录上留下<strong>版本链</strong>而不是就地覆盖——就地覆盖会让「这台设备被验了几次、结论怎么变的」不可追溯，而这类追溯在监管质询或大客户对账时是必需的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>验机项必须与报价特征快照一一对应，差异逐项独立比对，不用综合评级。</li>\n<li>能读到数字的项（电池、功能测试、激活锁）争议最低，靠目检与主观判断的项（划痕、拆修）争议最高，后者必须绑定标准光照照片与复核通道。</li>\n<li>机构间判定一致性用标准样本标定，监控指标用「相对品类基准的下调率偏离」而非绝对下调率。</li>\n<li>验机结果同时输出差异视图（结算用）与状态视图（路线决策用），两者不可混成同一字段。</li>\n<li>电池健康同时存原始数字与派生分档，保留阈值调整时的历史可重算性。</li>\n<li>复核由差异条目驱动，且必须留下验机结论的版本链而非就地覆盖。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"到检验机与重新定级","id":"到检验机与重新定级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：验机项与特征的一一对应","id":"核心概念-验机项与特征的一一对应"},{"level":2,"text":"验机标准的分级标定","id":"验机标准的分级标定"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化功能测试的边界","id":"自动化功能测试的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"从验机结果到实检价","id":"从验机结果到实检价"},{"level":3,"text":"电池健康的分档与数字","id":"电池健康的分档与数字"},{"level":2,"text":"重新定级与下游路线","id":"重新定级与下游路线"},{"level":3,"text":"复核与重新验机","id":"复核与重新验机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"旧品上门取件与寄回包材","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/tradein-pickup-pack-kit"},"next":{"title":"估价差异补退结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/price-diff-settlement"}}